### Groot Admin - Get Shell Scripts
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/admin/kamehouse-shell/scripts.php

### Groot Admin - Execute Shell Script (no script param - Expect 400)
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/admin/kamehouse-shell/execute.php

### Groot Admin - Execute Shell Script (vlc-start.sh)
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/admin/kamehouse-shell/execute.php?script=vlc/vlc-start.sh&args=-f%20C:/Users/nbrest/git/kamehouse-video-playlists/playlists/video-streaming-sftp-lan/anime/captain_tsubasa_movies/captain_tsubasa_movies.m3u&isDaemon=true

### Groot Admin - Execute Shell Script (docker-integration-tests-run.sh)
GET {{SERVER_GROOT_DOCKER}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/admin/kamehouse-shell/execute.php?script=docker/docker-integration-tests-run.sh


### Groot Auth - Login
POST {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/auth/login.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{USERNAME}}&password={{PASSWORD}}

### Groot Auth - Logout
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/auth/logout.php


### Groot Commons - Session Status
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/commons/session/status.php


### Groot Test - Test endpoint
GET {{SERVER_GROOT}}/kame-house-groot/api/v1/test/test.php
